  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Elevated, quiet and with a glistening outlook over the bays and Lake Pupuke, you'll love coming home to this north facing Takapuna apartment with underground car park.\r\nThe Spencer on Byron has always been a popular choice.\r\nA well kept building with resort style facilities located in the middle of Takapuna - but without the 'North Shore price tag'!\r\nAffordability but without compromising location - that's smart buying.\r\n \r\nYou might be looking for your next home or it might be a home for a stable tenant - for which the demand is high.\r\nThese apartments also make a fabulous lock up and leave for out of towners who need an Auckland base.\r\nWalk to the beach or some of Auckland's most vibrant bars and restaurants. \r\nCoffee is always close and always top notch in this part of town.\r\nA pool, spa, full sized gym and tennis court are at your disposal for added convenience, not that you'd need it.\r\n \r\nContact James Mairs for more info today!\r\n\r\nCurrently in the hotel pool but the new owner can move in.",
